      "message": "keeping listener object once is created first. Will ask bluetooth team to see whether we can get rid of mPendingPanRequests. Otherwise I still need mBluetoothPan to null while onServiceDisconnected. Because I need to know whether to put the request into mPendingPanRequests while pan is unavailable (onServiceDisconnected).",
